====== Hame MPR-A1 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

Small device with a 1800mAh Li-polymer rechargeable battery.

  * RJ45 Port: 1 WAN (Support DHCP, ADSL, Static IP) or LAN
  * Size: 95 x 35 x 15 mm, Net Weight: 57g.

There are many clones of this device in similar package, but not marked as HAME and likely produced by other vendors.

DealExtreme sells a clone of HAME MPR-A1 named [[http://dx.com/p/portable-3g-802-11a-b-g-n-150mbps-wireless-mobile-power-router-white-blue-167998|E-Suter]], and they provided a new [[http://club.dx.com/forums/forums.dx/threadid.1268902|english firmware]].

